{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the enigmatic and liminal worlds of Backrooms Interception, discover the terrifying fates of engineers and scientists that once worked in these worlds. As you uncover more about your purpose there, you will be met with characters and choices that influence the outcome of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game doesn\u2019t force you to follow a narrative; your choices, from dialogue to who you choose to kill, affect the outcome of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/a20f0d1d8c9c6d3bc9ab0d18b475c3e1.avif?t=1771870673\" width=780 height=68 /></span><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Interception has a unique take on the backrooms concept, with a lot of fan favorite levels as well as our original ones that flow with the game's dark story and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to find any means necessary to survive\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game rewards salvaging for resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels have random events that make the game less linear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some environments may change the time and look as you progress </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/009828c893951c3a48e6d3ecfd0c70e5.poster.avif?t=1771870673\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/009828c893951c3a48e6d3ecfd0c70e5.webm?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/009828c893951c3a48e6d3ecfd0c70e5.mp4?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/02c39d226c2ebc3c7c9f694db73b45f4.avif?t=1771870673\" width=780 height=68 /></span>ITEMS AND INVENTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world isn't like ours; you will need to salvage equipment and tools that are left behind, your resources are extremely limited and you have to be strategic with your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You need to Eat and Drink or else you risk fatigue and exhaustion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your backpack can only carry so much, your luggage space is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapons aren\u2019t durable; you will need to repair them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your magazines won\u2019t load themselves, you do it manually</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you manage to survive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/333dadc39edeb5287d1a13c657da48c5.poster.avif?t=1771870673\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/333dadc39edeb5287d1a13c657da48c5.webm?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/333dadc39edeb5287d1a13c657da48c5.mp4?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/61e3edf7b3c9fd5be2d9cd1ca8f823e1.avif?t=1771870673\" width=780 height=68 /></span>COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is at stake every second you spend inside backrooms, safe spaces are as rare as they can be, and you will need to rely on your skills in combat to survive even the smallest of threats as you navigate its levels. At your disposal, you will have a lot of choices\u2026 but so do they\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold Weapons such as Swords and Axes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms that require bullets that are few and far between</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enigmatic and reality bending entities that don\u2019t respect the rules of reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fellow humans won\u2019t hesitate to gun you down if you point your gun at them, they are as tense as you are at times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be discouraged by death, game only punishes not adapting\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be aware and always keep your weapon ready...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/d45c74e9a8d12c7194f92bad6c47cdbf.poster.avif?t=1771870673\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/d45c74e9a8d12c7194f92bad6c47cdbf.webm?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/d45c74e9a8d12c7194f92bad6c47cdbf.mp4?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/768f8d3912ad3121678056554a116cba.poster.avif?t=1771870673\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/768f8d3912ad3121678056554a116cba.webm?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/768f8d3912ad3121678056554a116cba.mp4?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/6780b30e4cffc506672c7d4b9c0e2de3.avif?t=1771870673\" width=780 height=68 /></span><strong>AFFLICTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters that you play are still human, they also suffer from injuries and illnesses. The Environments and Entities you face will test your character's resilience to its limits\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status effects system that makes that expensive vest seem worth it when you get hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities may poison you, infect you, make you hallucinate or even give you radiation poisoning there\u2019s no limit in this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your Hunger, Thirst, and Sanity intact or you may start Wrenching (turning into one of them\u2026.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Would you risk it if your life was on the line?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/21509b8368fb841ebcaa3aeb9f87dcc3.poster.avif?t=1771870673\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/21509b8368fb841ebcaa3aeb9f87dcc3.webm?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/21509b8368fb841ebcaa3aeb9f87dcc3.mp4?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are free to try out the game for yourself; DEMO IS AVAILABLE NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is quite lengthy it features an intro to the story as well as the full Poolrooms storyline. While it may be janky at times, we are regularly updating it and improving the game. Be sure to Wishlist the game if you like what you see. We will see you in the backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1771870673\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1771870673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2523460?t=1771870673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/2221f65906cd94bf6fd9f5ae34c0bf53cf246fc3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771870673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/37183eb84d53c4965378eb02342c5ede83ecad5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771870673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/37183eb84d53c4965378eb02342c5ede83ecad5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771870673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the enigmatic and liminal worlds of Backrooms Interception, discover the terrifying fates of engineers and scientists that once worked in these worlds. As you uncover more about your purpose there, you will be met with characters and choices that influence the outcome of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game doesn\u2019t force you to follow a narrative; your choices, from dialogue to who you choose to kill, affect the outcome of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/a20f0d1d8c9c6d3bc9ab0d18b475c3e1.avif?t=1771870673\" width=780 height=68 /></span><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Interception has a unique take on the backrooms concept, with a lot of fan favorite levels as well as our original ones that flow with the game's dark story and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to find any means necessary to survive\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game rewards salvaging for resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels have random events that make the game less linear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some environments may change the time and look as you progress </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic